@base = http://localhost:5063
@organizationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@projectId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@session = replace-with-browser-session-token

### Published managed catalog for an active, authorized project
GET {{base}}/management/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/projects/{{projectId}}/catalog/models
Cookie: __Host-uzllm-session={{session}}

### Unknown project returns 404 after organization authorization
GET {{base}}/management/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/projects/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099/catalog/models
Cookie: __Host-uzllm-session={{session}}
